    {
      "id": "claim_1d82fd64055a4062925029c4ae4e6575",
      "statement": "The server entrypoint loads config, initializes the logger, then constructs four independent ZeroHub instances (static, random, IP, permanent) and passes them to the handler, so each hub type has an isolated hub registry.",
